  pnl_att_failed: ["Decisão não confirmada: {reason}. Reabra a revisão antes de repetir.","Decision not confirmed: {reason}. Reopen the review before repeating.","Decisión no confirmada: {reason}. Vuelve a abrir la revisión antes de repetir.","Décision non confirmée : {reason}. Rouvrez la revue avant de recommencer.","Entscheidung nicht bestätigt: {reason}. Prüfung vor einer Wiederholung neu öffnen.","Decisione non confermata: {reason}. Riapri la revisione prima di ripetere.","判断は確認されていません: {reason}。繰り返す前にレビューを開き直してください。","결정이 확인되지 않았습니다: {reason}. 반복하기 전에 검토를 다시 여세요.","决定未确认：{reason}。重复前请重新打开审阅。","لم يُؤكَّد القرار: {reason}. أعد فتح المراجعة قبل التكرار."],
