  pnl_editor_footer: ["Somente leitura: peça a alteração na conversa para revisar o diff antes de gravar.","Read only: ask for the change in the conversation to review the diff before it is written.","Solo lectura: pide el cambio en la conversación para revisar el diff antes de escribir.","Lecture seule : demandez la modification dans la conversation pour revoir le diff avant l'écriture.","Nur lesen: Änderung im Chat anfordern, um den Diff vor dem Schreiben zu prüfen.","Sola lettura: chiedi la modifica nella conversazione per rivedere il diff prima della scrittura.","読み取り専用: 会話で変更を依頼すると、書き込み前に差分を確認できます。","읽기 전용: 대화에서 변경을 요청하면 쓰기 전에 차이를 검토할 수 있습니다.","只读：在对话中请求修改，即可在写入前审阅差异。","للقراءة فقط: اطلب التغيير في المحادثة لمراجعة الفروق قبل الكتابة."],
